<title>GERMANY: MG says Q1 96/97 pretax profit up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>MG says Q1 96/97 pretax profit up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to December 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     26.7    vs 22.4</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,800   vs 3,400</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified engineering and trading group is Metallgesellschaft AG. The company said in a mandatory statement its group workforce totalled 23,025 people at the end of December.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
